| **Environment separation** | Different secrets for dev/staging/prod |
| **Audit and monitor** | Log secret access (but not the secrets themselves) |
| **Cache secrets in memory** | Reduce API calls to secrets manager |
| **Graceful degradation** | Don't expose secrets in error messages |

